  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "SBI Aurum is the most premium offering of SBI Card, designed for the ultra-elites. The card offers some exclusive privileges like AURUM’s Secretarial Access , complimentary membership to Inflection Point Venture (IPV) , and digital subscriptions to The Wall Street Journal and Mint. Such perks complement the high-end lifestyle and are comparably distinct as offered by other premium cards like HDFC Infinia and ICICI Emeralde Private. Beyond these, Aurum also offers some expected premium features like unlimited international airport lounge access, low forex markup fees, and air miles conversion, among others. However, despite these advantages, Aurum fails to match up to its competitors due to two basic yet important features. 1. Reward Rate: For a premium credit card, the card offers a very low reward rate of just 1%, in comparison to other cards like Infinia (3.33%-33%) and Emeralde Private (3%). 2. Lounge Access: While the lounge access benefits are unlimited for international lounges, domestic lounge access is limited to 16 in a year (4 per quarter).",
